  "description": "Syncfusion® ASP.NET Core 3D Chart control enables developers to create stunning three-dimensional chart visualizations for data-driven ASP.NET Core web applications. It supports 3D versions of popular chart types including Column, Bar, Stacked Column, Stacked Bar, and 100percentage Stacked charts. The control provides features like 3D rotation, tilt, depth configuration, legends, data labels, tooltips, and multiple axis support, making it ideal for analytics dashboards and business intelligence applications.",
